ething at the Movies (Voracious Film Discussions Press), pp.302-303","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/7/7e/Ilostsomethingatthemovies.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191005224533 \"Ilostsomethingatthemovies.PNG (137 KB","line":722},{"title":"I Lost Something at the Movies","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/I_Lost_Something_at_the_Movies \"I Lost Something at the Movies\"","line":724},{"title":"Lena Pukalie","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/Lena_Pukalie \"Lena Pukalie\"","line":724},{"title":"![Lemony Snicket, The Reptile Room (HarperCollins, 1999), p.169","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/2/23/Trr_tua.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191005224757 \"Trr tua.PNG (473 KB","line":726},{"title":"![Tony \"Mommy\" Eggmonteror, The Mamba du Mal: A Snake That Will Never Kill Me (Venom Feels Delightful Press), p.169","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/3/3d/Mambadumal.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191005224931 \"Mambadumal.PNG (736 KB","line":728},{"title":"Tony \"Mommy\" Eggmonteror","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/Monty_Montgomery \"Monty Montgomery\"","line":730},{"title":"The Mamba du Mal: A Snake That Will Never Kill Me","target":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mamba_du_Mal:_A_Snake_That_Will_Never_Kill_Me \"The Mamba du Mal: A Snake That Will Never Kill Me\"","line":730},{"title":"![The Brothers Grimm, \"THe Three Languages\", from Grimm's Fairy Tales, (Mänchen Press), pp.2,3,6","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/9/97/Thethreelanguages_tua.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/112?cb=20191005225151 \"Thethreelanguages tua.PNG (784 KB","line":732},{"title":"![Laura Ingalls Wilder, Little House in the Big Woods (Harper Trophy, 1994), pg.3, Found Tangled in the branches of Nevermore Tree.","target":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/snicket/images/f/fe/Littlehouseinthebigwoods_snippet.PNG/revi